{"id":"n57306-1-7","stage":1,"title":"사탕 · 糖","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57306-1-7-1","ko":"무슨 사탕을 그렇게 많이 샀어?","zh":"怎么买了这么多糖果啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사탕을","meaning":"糖，糖果，糖块","explanation":"사탕：糖，糖果，糖块；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사탕","audio":"/audio/fc8bc61c4689549766ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57306","senseId":"1","lemma":"사탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샀어?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"fc8bc61c46895497","term":"사탕","zh":"糖，糖果，糖块","audio":"/audio/fc8bc61c4689549766ad.mp3","entryId":"57306","definition":"用饴糖或白糖熬制成的硬而甜的点心，大小正适合入口。","pronunciation":["사탕"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/